## Execution
Runs: batch
Expected runtime: under 10 minutes; expected output size: under 5 MB. `batch` -- this workspace's configured scheduler,
whatever it is (decision 0039) -- is the default for every analysis, whatever its size
(decision 0027). `sbatch` is accepted as its Slurm-era spelling and means the same thing.
The login node's cgroup kills whatever is running when memory runs short, not whatever is at fault, and a wrong size estimate is exactly the mistake a default cannot make.
